###Create
POST http://localhost:8080/principal/mesas
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "idAtendenteResponsavel": null,
  "numeroMesa": 10,
  "quantidadePessoas": 5,
  "idCliente": null,
  "status": "OCUPADA"
}


###Read
GET http://localhost:8080/principal/mesas/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###Read Copy
GET http://localhost:8080/principal/mesas/por-numero/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###Read todas as mesas
GET http://localhost:8080/principal/mesas/abertas
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###Read com Pesquisa
GET http://localhost:8080/financeiro/categoria-contas/buscar?
    nomeCategoria=Alimentos
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/principal/mesas/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "idAtendenteResponsavel": 3,
  "numeroMesa": 9,
  "quantidadePessoas": 2,
  "idCliente": 3,
  "status": "OCUPADA",
  "taxaServico": null
}


###Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/principal/mesas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json